    },
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Dishonest scales are detestable to the Lord,",
          "but an accurate weight is his delight."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When arrogance comes, disgrace follows,",
          "but with humility comes wisdom."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The integrity of the upright guides them,",
          "but the perversity of the treacherous destroys them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wealth is not profitable on a day of wrath,",
          "but righteousness rescues from death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteousness of the blameless clears his path,",
          "but the wicked person will fall because of his wickedness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteousness of the upright rescues them,",
          "but the treacherous are trapped by their own desires."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When the wicked person dies,",
          "his expectation comes to nothing,",
          "and hope placed in wealth , vanishes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteous one is rescued from trouble;",
          "in his place, the wicked one goes in."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "With his mouth the ungodly destroys his neighbor,",
          "but through knowledge the righteous are rescued."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When the righteous thrive, a city rejoices;",
          "when the wicked die, there is joyful shouting."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A city is built up by the blessing of the upright,",
          "but it is torn down by the mouth of the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whoever shows contempt for his neighbor lacks sense,",
          "but a person with understanding keeps silent."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A gossip goes around revealing a secret,",
          "but a trustworthy person keeps a confidence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Without guidance, a people will fall,",
          "but with many counselors there is deliverance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If someone puts up security for a stranger,",
          "he will suffer for it,",
          "but the one who hates such agreements is protected."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A gracious woman gains honor,",
          "but violent people gain only riches."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A kind man benefits himself,",
          "but a cruel person brings ruin on himself."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked person earns an empty wage,",
          "but the one who sows righteousness, a true reward."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Genuine righteousness leads to life,",
          "but pursuing evil leads to death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Those with twisted minds are detestable to the Lord,",
          "but those with blameless conduct are his delight."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Be assured that a wicked person",
          "will not go unpunished,",
          "but the offspring of the righteous will escape."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A beautiful woman who rejects good sense",
          "is like a gold ring in a pig’s snout."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The desire of the righteous turns out well,",
          "but the hope of the wicked leads to wrath."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "One person gives freely,",
          "yet gains more;",
          "another withholds what is right,",
          "only to become poor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A generous person will be enriched,",
          "and the one who gives a drink of water",
          "will receive water."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "People will curse anyone who hoards grain,",
          "but a blessing will come to the one who sells it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who searches for what is good seeks favor,",
          "but if someone looks for trouble, it will come to him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Anyone trusting in his riches will fall,",
          "but the righteous will flourish like foliage."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who brings ruin on his household",
          "will inherit the wind,",
          "and a fool will be a slave",
          "to someone whose heart is wise."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life,",
          "but a cunning person takes lives."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If the righteous will be repaid on earth,",
          "how much more the wicked and sinful."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
